body:
Hi {{contact_first}},

I'm {{my_name}}, and I DJ as {{dj_name}}. [One line on why you fit: a night they host, an artist they've booked, or the crowd you'd bring.]

{{bio_short}}

I'd love to play {{venue}}. These dates are open, and I'm flexible on the slot:
{{availability}}

Mix / EPK: {{epk}}
Instagram: {{instagram}}

Would any of these work? I'm easy to work with and will promote the night on my channels.

Thanks,
{{my_name}}
{{dj_name}} · {{phone}}

Hi {{contact_first}},

Bumping this back up in case it got buried. I'd still love to bring {{dj_name}} to {{venue}}.

[One new thing since your first email: a recent show, a new mix or a release.]

Dates I'm holding open:
{{availability}}

Mix / EPK: {{epk}}

If you're not the right person for bookings, could you point me to who is?

Thanks so much,
{{my_name}}
{{dj_name}} · {{phone}}

Hi {{contact_first}},

Thank you for having me! Here's what I have so we're on the same page:

Event: {{show}}
Date: {{date}}
Venue: {{venue}}, {{address}}
Set time: {{set_time}}
Fee: {{fee}}

Could you confirm or fill in:
1. Contract or written agreement
2. Payment: any deposit, plus how and when the balance is paid
3. Load-in and soundcheck time, and parking
4. Gear on site (my tech rider is below)
5. Guest list spots
6. Your day-of contact number

Tech rider:
{{rider}}

For promo, here are my links and photos:
{{links}}
{{files}}

Tickets: {{ticket_link}}

I'll share the event on my socials as soon as the flyer is ready.

Thanks,
{{my_name}}
{{dj_name}} · {{phone}}

Hi {{contact_first}},

Thank you again for having me at {{venue}}. [One specific highlight: the crowd, a moment, or the team.]

Photos and video will land here as they come in: {{media_folder}}
Feel free to use them, and please tag {{instagram}} if you post.

As agreed, the fee was {{fee}}. [Invoice attached, or how to pay: Zelle, Venmo or ACH details.]

I'd love to come back. Here are some open dates:
{{availability}}

Any feedback on the night is always welcome.

Thanks,
{{my_name}}
{{dj_name}} · {{phone}}

Hi {{contact_first}},

Just confirming I received {{fee}} for {{show}} on {{date}}. Thank you for the smooth payment.

It was a pleasure working with you and the {{venue}} team. Keep me in mind for future nights; I'll keep you posted on new mixes and open dates.

Thanks,
{{my_name}}
{{dj_name}} · {{phone}}

Hi {{contact_first}},

Thanks for letting me know, and for taking the time to consider me. I completely understand.

I'd love to stay on your radar for future nights at {{venue}}. Here's my EPK for your files: {{epk}}

I'll check back in a few months with new mixes and dates.

All the best,
{{my_name}}
{{dj_name}} · {{phone}}

Hi {{contact_first}},

I'm {{my_name}}, and I DJ as {{dj_name}}. {{bio_short}}

I'd love to bring a night to {{venue}}. I'm flexible on format, whether that's a full residency slot, an opener, or a themed party.

EPK and mixes: {{epk}}
Instagram: {{instagram}}

Would you be open to a quick call or a date to try it out?

Thanks,
{{my_name}}
{{dj_name}} · {{phone}}

Hi {{contact_first}},

Thanks again for having me. Confirming the details so we're on the same page:

Date: {{date}}
Set time: {{set_time}}
Fee: {{fee}}

Could you send over the contract and any load-in or tech details? I'll share promo assets this week.

Thanks,
{{my_name}}
{{dj_name}} · {{phone}}

Hi {{contact_first}},

Thank you for having me at {{venue}} on {{date}}. I had a great time with that crowd.

I'd love to come back. Let me know what dates you have open in the next couple of months.

Thanks,
{{my_name}}
{{dj_name}} · {{phone}}

Hi {{contact_first}},

I've got a show coming up and would love to have you shoot it.

Event: {{show}}
Venue: {{venue}}, {{city}}
Date: {{date}}
Set time: {{set_time}}

When you're done, please upload everything here: {{media_folder}}

Let me know if you're available.

Thanks,
{{my_name}}
